<title>SPAIN: Spain to begin issuing 18-mth bills at auction.</title>
<headline>Spain to begin issuing 18-mth bills at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain will begin to issue 18-month Treasury bills on April 30, the general director of the Spanish Treasury Jaime Caruana told Reuters on Thursday.</p>
<p>He added that in the following months the Treasury will offer 18-month bills on a regular twice monthly basis along with one-year bills.</p>
</text>
